        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.39,
          "end": 104.37,
          "en": "that you always wanna apply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.37,
          "end": 107.07,
          "en": "And you could, for example here, set a base margin",
