          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 186.51,
          "end": 188.37,
          "en": "But often the better approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 190.92,
          "en": "is to use elevated button style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.92,
          "end": 193.89,
          "en": "from which again uses Flutter's default styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 193.89,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "and then allows you to override some selected styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 200.64,
          "en": "Unfortunately, we have inconsistencies like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.64,
          "end": 203.91,
          "en": "in the theming system where sometimes it's copy with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.91,
          "end": 206.31,
          "en": "and sometimes it's an approach like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.31,
          "end": 208.11,
          "en": "but that's why I'm showing this to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 211.53,
          "en": "for some of the most important widgets you'll work with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.53,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "And as always, the official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.72,
          "en": "and also simply Google is your friend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 218.46,
          "en": "when it comes to finding out",
