        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.81,
          "end": 237.18,
          "en": "because that's always the idea behind theming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 237.18,
          "end": 240.903,
          "en": "you always set up styles for all widgets in the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.74,
          "end": 244.89,
          "en": "And here we could, for example, change the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 244.89,
          "end": 246.63,
          "en": "of our elevated buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 246.63,
          "end": 250.83,
          "en": "and set this to K color scheme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 250.83,
          "end": 253.8,
          "en": "primary container in my case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 253.8,
          "end": 257.25,
          "en": "And if I do that and we enforce these changes,",
