        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 285.87,
          "end": 289.17,
          "en": "in my general main theme data object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 289.17,
          "end": 291.99,
          "en": "is the text theme parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 291.99,
          "end": 294.09000000000003,
          "en": "Because of course in our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 294.09000000000003,
          "end": 297.57,
          "en": "we also have many places where we output text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 297.57,
          "end": 300.69,
          "en": "like for example here in the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 300.69,
          "end": 303.93,
          "en": "And of course the default text styles might work for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 303.93,
          "end": 306.84,
          "en": "but you can of course also fine tune those.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 306.84,
          "end": 310.11,
          "en": "And the best way of fine tuning them on a global level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 310.11,
          "end": 312.21,
          "en": "is to set the text theme parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 312.21,
          "end": 313.683,
          "en": "in your theme data object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.58,
          "end": 317.19,
          "en": "Now this one's a text theme object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 317.19,
          "end": 318.39,
          "en": "and of course as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 318.39,
          "end": 320.49,
          "en": "you could create one from the ground up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 320.49,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "and then target the different kinds of text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 326.04,
          "en": "you might be using in your app manually here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 326.04,
          "end": 329.43,
          "en": "But I personally prefer creating a theme data object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 329.43,
          "end": 332.01,
          "en": "here again, and then on that object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 332.01,
          "end": 333.693,
          "en": "accessing the text theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 334.68,
          "end": 336.78,
          "en": "And then on that text theme here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 336.78,
          "end": 338.85,
          "en": "you can again call copy with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 338.85,
          "end": 341.22,
          "en": "This ensures that you're overriding the text theme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 341.22,
          "end": 344.46,
          "en": "that belongs to your theme data object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 344.46,
          "end": 345.54,
          "en": "Now, in copy with,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 345.54,
          "end": 348.03,
          "en": "you can then target different parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 348.03,
          "end": 352.23,
          "en": "And these parameters represent different kinds of texts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 352.23,
          "end": 355.68,
          "en": "that are used in different parts of your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 355.68,
          "end": 358.86,
          "en": "For example, the text used here in the app bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 358.86,
          "end": 361.77,
          "en": "is the title large text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 361.77,
          "end": 363.27,
          "en": "Now how do I know that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 363.27,
          "end": 366.66,
          "en": "Well, the official documentation of course helps with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 366.66,
          "end": 367.86,
          "en": "But in addition to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 367.86,
          "end": 370.74,
          "en": "you can also simply try out setting those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
